flowchart TD
    R["Director-General is satisfied<br/>REASONABLE DOUBT exists<br/>about safety of the aircraft<br/>or of its type"]
    R --> O1["Option (a)<br/>SUSPEND or CANCEL<br/>the C of A / Special C of A"]
    R --> O2["Option (b)<br/>REQUIRE modification, repair,<br/>replacement, overhaul, inspection<br/>(incl. flight tests & examination)<br/>under an approved person"]
    O2 --> Y["Compliance becomes a CONDITION<br/>of the C of A remaining in force"]
    O1 --> Z["Aircraft must NOT be flown<br/>while the C of A is suspended"]
    Z --> SFP["On application by owner / operator,<br/>the DG MAY issue a<br/>SPECIAL FLIGHT PERMIT"]
